{%- assign s = settings -%}
<p>{% if s.blanket_purchase %}Inspired by what you told Buddy.{% else %}Your dog, the details you shared with Buddy, and your exact note.{% endif %}</p>
              {%- comment -%} Their toy or collar, on the page where the photo goes (Krish, 28 Oct: "I cant seem to
                upload any images of accessories"). The painter reads one photo, the dog's, so the words go into the
                painting now; photos of the toy or collar go to our artist with the Artist's touch, added with the gift
                (hs2.js bindExtras, extrasAfterAdd). Words the chat already has show as one line with Change; the
                examples read as examples, never as answers; the Artist's touch is a button with its price and its
                5 days, then "Added. Remove" (28 Oct recordings). {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="hs-extras" data-hs-extras hidden>
                <p class="hs-extras__said" data-hs-extras-summary hidden><span><strong>In the painting too:</strong> <span data-hs-extras-said></span></span> <button type="button" class="hs-extras__change" data-hs-extras-change>Change</button></p>
                <div class="hs-extras__ask" data-hs-extras-ask>
                  <p class="hs-extras__title">Paint their toy or collar too?</p>
                  <p class="hs-extras__hint">A few words is plenty. Optional.</p>
                  <div class="hs-extras__fields">
                    <label>Favorite toy<input type="text" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" placeholder="For example, a squeaky duck" data-hs-extra="toy"></label>
                    <label>Collar or accessory<input type="text" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" placeholder="For example, a red bandana" data-hs-extra="accessory"></label>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hs-extras__artist" data-hs-extras-artist data-hs-extras-state="off" hidden>
                  <div class="hs-extras__offer" data-hs-extras-offer>
                    <button type="button" class="hs-extras__add" data-hs-extras-add>Add our artist's touch, <span data-hs-extras-price></span></button>
                    <p class="hs-extras__sub">Adds 5&nbsp;days. A person reworks your design by&nbsp;hand.</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="hs-extras__on" data-hs-extras-on hidden>
                    <p class="hs-extras__added">Added. <button type="button" class="hs-extras__remove" data-hs-extras-remove>Remove</button></p>
                    <p>It goes in with your gift and adds 5&nbsp;days. Our artist reworks your design by hand from your notes and photos, and a person checks it before it prints.</p>
                    <label>What should our artist add?<textarea maxlength="500" rows="2" data-hs-extras-notes placeholder="For example, the toy by the front paws"></textarea></label>
                    {%- for i in (1..3) -%}
                    <div class="hs-extras__photo">
                      <select aria-label="What photo {{ i }} shows" data-hs-extras-tag><option{% if i == 1 %} selected{% endif %}>Favorite toy</option><option{% if i == 2 %} selected{% endif %}>Collar or accessory</option><option{% if i == 3 %} selected{% endif %}>Another photo of my dog</option><option>Something else</option></select>
                      <label class="hs-file"><input type="file" accept="image/*" aria-label="Photo {{ i }}" data-hs-extras-file><span class="hs-file__text" data-hs-file-text data-hs-file-empty="Choose photo {{ i }}">Choose photo {{ i }}</span></label>
                    </div>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </div>
                  <p class="hs-extras__status" data-hs-extras-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p data-hs2-checkout-image-status role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
              {%- comment -%} the on-device photo check (hs-photo-quality.js): why a photo won't work, and an override for a dog
                the detector missed. hs2.js photoNote puts each outcome under the button the buyer tapped and right after
                Teeinblue's photo field; this box holds it only while Teeinblue has not drawn that field. {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="hs-photo-check" data-hs2-photo-check aria-live="polite" hidden>
                <p data-hs2-photo-check-text></p>
                <button type="button" data-hs2-photo-override hidden>It's my dog. Use this photo.</button>
              </div>
              <p data-hs2-artwork-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose your style and tone, then add your dog's photo below.</p>
              {%- comment -%} The photo the buyer gave Buddy, as one choice (Krish, 28 Oct: "the UI should absolutely really be
                asking if you want to add to that or use a different picture"). hs2.js updateBlanketPurchaseStatus names the dog;
                the first button starts the painting, the second opens the phone's picker in the same tap. {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="hs-photo-choice" data-hs2-blanket-photo hidden>
                <img class="hs-photo-choice__img" data-hs2-blanket-photo-img alt="The photo you gave Buddy" width="64" height="64">
                <div class="hs-photo-choice__body">
                  <p class="hs-photo-choice__ask" data-hs2-blanket-photo-line>Paint your dog from this photo?</p>
                  <p class="hs-photo-choice__hint">This starts the painting. It takes about a minute.</p>
                  <div class="hs-photo-choice__actions">
                    <button type="button" class="hs-photo-choice__use" data-hs2-blanket-create>Use your dog's photo</button>
                    <button type="button" class="hs-photo-choice__other" data-hs2-photo-different>Use a different photo</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="hs-photo-note" data-hs2-blanket-photo-status hidden><p data-hs-photo-note-text></p><button type="button" data-hs-photo-note-override hidden>It's my dog. Use this photo.</button></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              {%- comment -%} The painting, then the finished design with the review right under it (Krish, 28 Oct:
                the wait "looks broken" and the tickbox sat above the picture where he barely saw it).
                hs2.js artStage() runs it; the wait is honest: about a minute, never a fake finish. {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="hs-art" data-hs-art data-state="idle" style="{% if s.native_artwork_kind == 'mug' %}--hs-art-ratio: 3 / 2; --hs-art-r: 1.5{% elsif s.native_artwork_kind == 'print' %}--hs-art-ratio: 2 / 3; --hs-art-r: 0.6667{% else %}--hs-art-ratio: 5 / 6; --hs-art-r: 0.8333{% endif %}" hidden>
                <div class="hs-art__canvas" data-hs-art-canvas>
                  <div class="hs-art__wash" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                  <img class="hs-art__photo" data-hs-art-photo alt="" width="480" height="480" hidden>
                  <svg class="hs-art__brush" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="56" height="56"><path d="M44 6c4 0 14 10 14 14 0 3-16 20-22 24l-6-6c4-6 11-32 14-32Z" fill="#121010"/><path d="M28 40l6 6c-2 6-7 12-16 12-5 0-10-2-12-4 6-1 8-4 9-8 1-5 7-8 13-6Z" fill="#a8284e"/></svg>
                  <img class="hs-art__result" data-hs-art-result alt="Your finished artwork" width="1000" height="1200" hidden>
                </div>
                <div class="hs-art__painting" data-hs-art-painting>
                  <p class="hs-art__title" data-hs-art-title>Painting your dog</p>
                  <p class="hs-art__line" data-hs-art-line>Mixing the paint.</p>
                  <div class="hs-art__bar" data-hs-art-bar role="progressbar" aria-label="Painting" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0"><span></span></div>
                  <p class="hs-art__note">About a minute. Stay here and I'll show you the moment it's ready.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="hs-art__done" data-hs-art-done hidden>
                  <p class="hs-art__title" data-hs-art-done-title tabindex="-1">Here's your dog.</p>
                  <a class="hs-art__full" data-hs2-artwork-source data-hs2-artwork-layer="{% if s.native_artwork_kind == 'mug' %}layer-696867{% elsif s.native_artwork_kind == 'print' %}layer-747218{% else %}layer-292294{% endif %}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>See it full size</a>
                  <label class="hs-art__accept" data-hs2-artwork-accept-wrap hidden>
                    <input type="checkbox" data-hs2-artwork-accept>
                    <span class="hs-art__box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span><strong data-hs-art-yes>Yes, this is my dog.</strong> I checked every face, marking and paw{% unless s.blanket_purchase %}, and the note and signature{% endunless %}, and I want this design on my gift.</span>
                  </label>
                  <p class="hs-art__redo">Not quite right? Choose another photo below to make a new version.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <details data-hs2-upload-recovery hidden>
                <summary>Artwork failed or stopped?</summary>
                <p>Wait while your artwork is still being created. If an error appears and no artwork arrives, you can allow another upload. This will not start a new artwork until you choose a photo again.</p>
                <label><input type="checkbox" data-hs2-upload-retry-ack> My artwork failed, and I want to choose a photo again.</label>
                <button type="button" data-hs2-upload-retry disabled>Allow another upload</button>
              </details>
